  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "note": "Fail-closed ledger of which runner evaluates which UI oracle. A runner that emits no marker for an oracle produces no finding for it, which is indistinguishable from a clean result, so every runner must state each oracle as evaluated, unavailable (with a reason the platform cannot express it), or unimplemented (nobody has written it yet). validation/oracles/check.py verifies every claim against the runner sources and rejects any marker the Rust parser consumes that no row covers.",
